<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Profit Peek | Leave It to Bum Bum</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css"><?php require dirname(__DIR__, 2) . '/includes/analytics.php'; ?></head><body><header class="shell"><a class="brand" href="/">BB · Leave It to Bum Bum</a><span><?php require dirname(__DIR__, 2) . '/includes/meter.php'; ?> <a href="/account/">Account</a></span></header><main class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Bum Bum’s toolbox</p><h1>Will this job actually make money?</h1><p class="lede">Add the rough numbers. Profit Peek gives you the expected profit and margin. A successful calculation uses one action.</p>
